12
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
2012: Supernova is a 2009 direct-to-video science fiction disaster film directed by Anthony
Fankhauser and starring Brian Krause, Heather McComb, and Najarra Townsend.

13
01:02:50,000 --> 01:02:56,000
It was distributed by The Asylum.

14
01:07:40,000 --> 01:07:46,000
As with the previous film, titled 2012: Doomsday, 2012: Supernova is a mockbuster of
the Roland Emmerich film  2012, which was released a month later.

15
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:36,000
It is the second film in the Asylum's 2012 trilogy though the
films have nothing to do with one another.

16
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
The third film is titled 2012: Ice Age which was released in 2011.

17
01:22:10,000 --> 01:22:16,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
